      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲉϥϣⲟⲟⲡ ϩⲛⲛⲉⲙϩⲁⲟⲩ ⲉⲙⲡⲉϣⲗⲁⲁⲩ ϭⲉ ϭⲙϭⲟⲙ ⲉⲙⲟⲣϥ ϩⲛ**ϩⲁⲗⲩⲥⲓⲥ** ⲉⲃⲟⲗ",
      "english": "He lived in the tombs. Nobody could bind him any more, not even with chains,",
      "source": "41_Mark_5",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.sahidica:5",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
